Team ID:         SMTE
Task ID:         T621
Run ID:          R2

Type of training:
  Fine-tuning of PubMedBERT-large on GutBrainIE 2026 training data
  with pairwise relation classification (18 classes: 17 predicates + no_relation).

Pre-processing methods:
  - Title and abstract concatenated; abstract offsets shifted by len(title)+1.
  - Candidate pairs from all ordered (subject, object) entity pairs
    in the legal-pair dictionary (52 type pairs, 55 patterns).
  - Context: Local context window of +-300 characters around the entity pair (A5-large).
  - Entity markers [E1]...[/E1] and [E2]...[/E2] inserted at mention boundaries.
  - Mention-mean pooling over entity span hidden states.
  - Hard negative sampling: 70% hard negatives + 30% easy negatives.
  - Legal-only decoding with temperature scaling (T=1.25).
  - Distance-aware minimum probability floor.
  - Per-predicate threshold tuning (margin, min_prob, max_chars, top2_gap) on dev set.

Training data used:
  Gold + Silver + Silver 2025 + Bronze (4921 documents total).

Relevant details of the run:
  Model: PubMedBERT-large — folder: pubmedbert_large_re_A5_hardneg
  Entity mentions: from NER ensemble predictions (SMTE_T611_R1_NERensemble).
  lr=1e-5, 2 epochs, effective batch size 32, bf16, gradient checkpointing.
  Dev results: Macro-F1=0.5155, Micro-F1=0.5932.

GitHub repository:
  https://github.com/sofiamaule/GutBrainIE.git
